# Skill routing

Attach skills explicitly when the user invokes them or when intent matches:

| Skill | Attach when |
|-------|-------------|
| **fusion-sage** | UI/UX fusion, card layout, refresh bugs, `/fusion-sage` in message |
| **ai-optimization** | Large refactors, token/context pressure, multi-module QA exploration, `/ai-optimization` |

Do not duplicate skill bodies inline. If the task matches a skill trigger, tell the user to attach it or invoke `/skill-name` — skills correlate with deeper tool use in this repo's history.

For supply-chain or pnpm hardening, use the `supply-chain-harden` skill when creating audit/harden workflows.
